Z||000003||Bob Englert||04-14-2001||10:18 PM||||I had all kinds of clutch hydraulic problems with my first 85 SE 4cyl until I bit the bullet and bought a new GM master and slave.  After installing and bleeding, I NEVER had another problem with my clutch travel.  Sold the car a few months ago but I can't count the wasted time messing around with this.<P>When I start restoring my current 85 SE (resting peacefully at Ed Park's), I will only use genuine GM hydraulic parts.  I already have the new slave on the shelf waiting for me.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
